Package: ads1299eeg
Type: Package
Title: ADS1299 EEG Signal Processing Toolkit
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("ADS1299-Core-SDK", "Contributors", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "noreply@example.invalid")
Description: Lightweight, auditable EEG signal-processing utilities for data acquired with ADS1299 front ends. Includes signed 24-bit conversion, input-referred scaling, rereferencing, FIR filtering, Welch spectra, EEG band powers, signal-quality metrics, event-locked epochs, ERP summaries, coherence and an end-to-end starter pipeline. The package is intended for research, education and engineering validation, not clinical diagnosis.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
LazyData: false
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: stats, utils
